   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SARC-tj&#xe4;nsten &#xe4;r vald i samarbete med Multi och UNDP. Tj&#xe4;nsten vald utifr&#xe5;n Sidas prioriteringa och syftar till att st&#xe4;rka FN p&#xe5; landniv&#xe5;. Framtida karri&#xe4;rm&#xe4;jligheter inom omr&#xe5;dena bed&#xf6;ms som goda.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The SARC program (Special Assistant to Resident Coordinator) is an    important part of Swedish strategy to increase Swedish participation  in international organizations. The program offers young              professionals (under 39 years of age) who hold a Master degree the    opportunity to serve in the UN and other international organizations.</narrative>
